{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach and take object, check properties. Otherwise, move, scan area or do task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
